session-key negotiation, discovery) from tinytuya
(https://github.com/jasonacox/tinytuya), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Jason Cox.
The OWON PC321-TY energy-meter data-point map and the native timer formats
(cycle, random, inching) come from tuya-local
(https://github.com/make-all/tuya-local), MIT License, Copyright 2018 Nik Rolls,
2026 Jason Rumney, 2022-2026 other contributors. Both MIT licenses permit this
use provided the copyright and permission notices are kept; the full texts are
at the links above.

